" number of error  %(i1)d \n"
" \n"

#. ALGELINE5_49 [assisted]
#: code_aster/Messages/algeline5.py:276
#, python-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"Le nombre de modes propres calculés (%(i1)d) est inférieur au nombre\n"
"de fréquences demandées (%(i2)d).\n"
" --> Le calcul continue, on ne prend que les %(i1)d premiers modes.\n"
"\n"
"Conseil\n"
"-------\n"
"La prochaine fois, relancez en augmentant la taille de l'espace de projection (mots-clés\n"
"COEF_DIM_ESPACE ou DIM_SOUS_ESPACE).\n"
"Vous pouvez aussi relancer en demandant moins de modes.\n"
"Si votre problème est fortement amorti, il est possible que des modes propres non calculés soient\n"
"sur amortis, diminuez alors le nombre de modes demandés.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"The number of computed modes (%(i1)d) is smaller than the number\n"
"of requested frequencies (%(i2)d).\n"
" --> The computation continues with only the first %(i1)d modes.\n"
"\n"
"Advice\n"
"------\n"
"Next time, run again with a larger projection space (keywords\n"
"COEF_DIM_ESPACE or DIM_SOUS_ESPACE).\n"
"You can also run again asking for fewer modes.\n"
"If your problem is heavily damped, some modes that were not computed may be\n"
"overdamped; then reduce the number of requested modes.\n"

#. ALGELINE5_50 [machine]
#: code_aster/Messages/algeline5.py:291
#, python-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"Le nombre de modes propres calculés (%(i1)d) est supérieur au nombre\n"
"de fréquences demandées (%(i2)d).\n"
"\n"
"--> Le calcul continue, on ne prend que les %(i2)d premiers modes.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"The number of computed eigenmodes (%(i1)d) is greater than the requested\n"
"number of frequencies (%(i2)d).\n"
"\n"
"--> The calculation continues, it only takes the %(i2)d first modes.\n"
"\n"

#. ALGELINE5_51 [assisted]
#: code_aster/Messages/algeline5.py:300
#, python-format
msgid ""
"\n"
" La valeur propre numéro %(i1)d a une partie imaginaire non négligeable.\n"
" Partie réelle     = %(r1)12.5E\n"
" Partie imaginaire = %(r2)12.5E\n"
"\n"
" Ce phénomène numérique est fréquent sur les valeurs propres en bordure du spectre recherché.\n"
"\n"
" Conseil\n"
" -------\n"
"  En cas de problème, la prochaine fois, relancez en demandant moins de modes ou en augmentant la\n"
"  taille de l'espace de projection (mots-clés COEF_DIM_ESPACE ou DIM_SOUS_ESPACE).\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
" Eigenvalue number %(i1)d has a non-negligible imaginary part.\n"
" Real part      = %(r1)12.5E\n"
" Imaginary part = %(r2)12.5E\n"
"\n"
" This numerical effect is common for eigenvalues at the edge of the searched spectrum.\n"
"\n"
" Advice\n"
" ------\n"
"  If there is a problem, next time run again asking for fewer modes or with a larger\n"
"  projection space (keywords COEF_DIM_ESPACE or DIM_SOUS_ESPACE).\n"

#. ALGELINE5_52 [machine]
#: code_aster/Messages/algeline5.py:314
#, python-format
msgid ""
"\n"
" LAIGLE: Erreur\n"
"   - Non convergence à l'itération max : %(i1)d\n"
"   - Convergence irrégulière & erreur >   %(r1)f\n"
"   - Diminuer la taille d'incrément.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
" LAIGLE: Error\n"
" - Non convergence with the iteration max:  %(i1)d \n"
" - Nonuniform Convergence & error > %(r1)f\n"
" - Diminuer size of increment. \n"

#. ALGELINE5_53 [assisted]
#: code_aster/Messages/algeline5.py:322
msgid ""
"\n"
" Erreur de programmation MULT_FRONT\n"
"   * Sur connexité des Lagrange Lambda1\n"
"Ce message est un message d'erreur développeur.\n"
"Contactez le support technique.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
" MULT_FRONT programming error\n"
"   * On connectivity of Lagrange Lambda1\n"
"This is a developer error message.\n"
"Contact technical support.\n"

#. ALGELINE5_54 [machine]
#: code_aster/Messages/algeline5.py:330
msgid ""
"\n"
"     ==== Type de maille Aster / Type de maille GMSH ====\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
" ==== Standard of Aster mesh / Type of mesh GMSH ==== \n"

