#. ALGELINE6_91 [assisted]
#: code_aster/Messages/algeline6.py:553
msgid ""
"\n"
"Problème interne ARPACK: Problème dans la factorisation d'Arnoldi.\n"
"\n"
"Ce message est un message d'erreur développeur.\n"
"Contactez le support technique.\n"
"\n"
"Conseils:\n"
"   Ce problème numérique ponctuel peut parfois se résoudre:\n"
"   - en changeant de solveur linéaire (mot-clé SOLVEUR=_F(METHODE='MUMPS' ou 'MULT_FRONT')),\n"
"   - si le solveur MUMPS est utilisé, en changeant son paramétrage numérique\n"
"     (par exemple: SOLVEUR=_F(METHODE='MUMPS', ELIM_LAGR='NON'),\n"
"   - en jouant sur le parallélisme MPI (activation ou non, nombre de processus MPI...),\n"
"   - en changeant de solveur modal (METHODE='TRI_DIAG' plutôt que 'SORENSEN'),\n"
"   - en modifiant la stratégie de calcul modal.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"ARPACK internal problem: problem in the Arnoldi factorization.\n"
"\n"
"This is a developer error message.\n"
"Contact technical support.\n"
"\n"
"Advice:\n"
"   This one-off numerical problem can sometimes be solved:\n"
"   - by changing the linear solver (keyword SOLVEUR=_F(METHODE='MUMPS' or 'MULT_FRONT')),\n"
"   - if solver MUMPS is used, by changing its numerical settings\n"
"     (for example: SOLVEUR=_F(METHODE='MUMPS', ELIM_LAGR='NON'),\n"
"   - by changing the MPI parallelism (on or off, number of MPI processes...),\n"
"   - by changing the modal solver (METHODE='TRI_DIAG' instead of 'SORENSEN'),\n"
"   - by changing the modal computation strategy.\n"

