"     générer des erreurs dans l'orientation des forces de contact.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"  -> Contact with DYNA_VIBRA: interpenetration exceeds (DIST_MAIT + DIST_ESCL).\n"
"  -> Risk & advice:\n"
"     DIST_MAIT and DIST_ESCL account for a material thickness not represented in the mesh\n"
"     (beam radius, shell thickness or simply a bump). Excessive interpenetration may come\n"
"     from an error in the command file: RIGI_NOR too low; contact nodes not facing each other;\n"
"     inconsistent OBSTACLE and NORM_OBSTACLE. For two beams with coincident neutral fibers, it can\n"
