msgstr "  One announces to the processor #0 that an exception was raised."

#. APPELMPI_94 [assisted]
#: code_aster/Messages/appelmpi.py:72
#, python-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"    Il n'y a plus de temps pour continuer.\n"
"    Le calcul sera interrompu à la fin de la prochaine itération, du prochain\n"
"    pas de temps ou de la prochaine commande, ou bien brutalement par le système.\n"
"\n"
"    On accorde un délai de %(r1).0f secondes pour la prochaine communication.\n"
"\n"
"    Conseil :\n"
"        Augmentez la limite en temps du calcul.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"    There is no time left to continue.\n"
"    The computation will stop at the end of the next iteration, the next\n"
"    time step or the next command, or abruptly by the system.\n"
"\n"
"    A delay of %(r1).0f seconds is allowed for the next communication.\n"
"\n"
"    Advice:\n"
"        Increase the time limit of the computation.\n"

#. APPELMPI_95 [machine]
#: code_aster/Messages/appelmpi.py:84
msgid ""
"\n"
"    Tous les processeurs sont synchronisés.\n"
"    Suite à une erreur sur un processeur, l'exécution est interrompue.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
" All the processors are synchronized. \n"
" Following an error on a processor, the execution is stopped. \n"

#. APPELMPI_96 [machine]
#: code_aster/Messages/appelmpi.py:90
#, python-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"  Le processeur #%(i1)d n'a pas répondu dans le délai imparti.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
" Processor # %(i1)d did not answer within the time limit. \n"

#. APPELMPI_97 [machine]
#: code_aster/Messages/appelmpi.py:95
#, python-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"    Le délai d'expiration de la communication est dépassé.\n"
"    Cela signifie que le processeur #0 attend depuis plus de %(r1).0f secondes,\n"
"    ce qui n'est pas normal.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
" The lead time of expiry of the communication is exceeded. \n"
" That means that the processor #0 waits since more %(r1).0f seconds,\n"
" which is not normal. \n"

#. APPELMPI_99 [machine]
#: code_aster/Messages/appelmpi.py:102
msgid ""
"\n"
"\n"
"    Au moins un processeur n'est pas en mesure de participer à la communication.\n"
"    L'exécution est donc interrompue.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
" \n"
" At least a processor is not able to take part in the communication. \n"
" The execution is thus stopped. \n"
" \n"

