"for abscissas X1 = %(r3)f, X2 = %(r4)f.\n"
"\n"
"Possible solutions:\n"
"-   Refine the mesh around the slope. \n"
"-   Adjust NB_POINT_1 and NB_POINT_2 so that the end points are not too close to sharp convex points on the slope.   \n"

