" Champ : %(k4)s\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
" You are projecting an unusual field onto the final model.\n"
" Check that the modeling types you use are compatible.\n"
"\n"
" Message for developers:\n"
" Parameter:  %(k1)s  of option:  %(k2)s  is not known to the TYPE_ELEM of LIGREL:  %(k3)s\n"
" Field: %(k4)s\n"

