" Field:  %(k4)s \n"

#. CALCULEL_55 [machine]
#: code_aster/Messages/calculel.py:375
#, python-format
msgid ""
"\n"
" Erreur utilisateur :\n"
"   On cherche à créer un CHAM_ELEM mais sur certains points, on ne trouve pas la composante : %(k1)s\n"
"   Champ : %(k4)s\n"
" Risques & conseils :\n"
"   Si la commande que vous exécutez comporte le mot clé PROL_ZERO='OUI', vous devriez peut-être l'utiliser.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
" User error: \n"
" One seeks to create a CHAM_ELEM but on certain points, one does not find the component:  %(k1)s \n"
" Field:  %(k4)s \n"
" Risks & advices: \n"
" If the command that you execute comprises key word PROL_ZERO='OUI', you should perhaps use it. \n"

#. CALCULEL_56 [machine]
#: code_aster/Messages/calculel.py:384
#, python-format
msgid ""
"\n"
" Le LIGREL contient des mailles tardives\n"
" Champ : %(k4)s\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
" The LIGREL contains late meshes\n"
" Champ:  %(k4)s \n"

#. CALCULEL_57 [machine]
#: code_aster/Messages/calculel.py:390
#, python-format
msgid ""
"\n"
" Erreur Utilisateur :\n"
"   On cherche à transformer un champ simple en CHAM_ELEM.\n"
"   Le nombre de \"points\" (points de Gauss ou noeuds) du champ simple (%(i2)d) est\n"
"   différent du nombre de points attendu pour le CHAM_ELEM (%(i1)d) :\n"
"     - maille              :  %(k1)s\n"
"     - nom du CHAM_ELEM    :  %(k4)s\n"
"     - nom du champ simple :  %(k5)s\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
" User error: \n"
" One seeks to transform a simple field into CHAM_ELEM. \n"
" The number of\" points\" (Gauss points or nodes) of the simple field ( %(i2)d)\n"
" different amongst points is expected for the CHAM_ELEM ( %(i1)d): \n"
" - mesh:  %(k1)s \n"
" - name of the CHAM_ELEM:  %(k4)s \n"
" - name of the simple field:  %(k5)s \n"
" \n"

#. CALCULEL_58 [machine]
#: code_aster/Messages/calculel.py:402
#, python-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"Erreur lors de la fabrication d'un champ par éléments :\n"
" Il manque la composante : %(k1)s  sur la maille : %(k2)s\n"
" Champ : %(k4)s\n"
"\n"
"Risques et conseils :\n"
" Si cette erreur se produit lors de l'exécution de la commande PROJ_CHAMP,\n"
" il est possible de poursuivre le calcul en choisissant PROL_ZERO='OUI'\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Error during the manufacture of a field by elements: \n"
" It misses the component:  %(k1)s on the mesh:  %(k2)s \n"
" Field:  %(k4)s \n"
" \n"
"Risks and advices: \n"
" If this error occurs during command execution PROJ_CHAMP,\n"
" it is possible to continue computation by choosing PROL_ZERO='OUI' \n"

