"  Le rang de la composante %(k3)s de %(k1)s correspond\n"
"  au rang de la composante %(k4)s de %(k2)s.\n"
"\n"
"Conseil :\n"
"  Si nécessaire, il faut demander une évolution du code.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Error in CREA_RESU: \n"
" When one uses command CREA_RESU with key word AFFE / CHAM_GD,\n"
" the components of the field of functions %(k2)s (of the geometry and/or time),\n"
" must be with the same row as those of the field of realities %(k1)s. \n"
"Inconsistency in the quantities %(k1)s and %(k2)s: \n"
" The row of the component %(k3)s of %(k1)s corresponds\n"
" to the row of the component %(k4)s of %(k2)s. \n"
" \n"
"Advice: \n"
" If necessary, it is necessary to ask an evolution of the code. \n"

