" It is impossible. \n"
" Accused types:  %(k1)s and %(k2)s\n"
" Advices: \n"
" It is perhaps about a programming error. \n"
" If it is command CREA_CHAMP, check key word TYPE_CHAM. \n"
" \n"

#. CALCULEL4_6 [assisted]
#: code_aster/Messages/calculel4.py:54
#, python-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"Erreur utilisateur (ou programmeur) :\n"
" On veut imposer la numérotation des ddls du CHAM_NO %(k1)s\n"
" avec le NUME_DDL %(k2)s.\n"
" Mais ces deux structures de données sont incompatibles.\n"
" Par exemple :\n"
"    - ce n'est pas le même maillage sous-jacent\n"
"    - ce n'est pas la même grandeur sous-jacente.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"User (or programmer) error:\n"
" The DOF numbering of CHAM_NO %(k1)s is to be imposed\n"
" with NUME_DDL %(k2)s.\n"
" But these two data structures are incompatible.\n"
" For example:\n"
"    - the underlying mesh is not the same\n"
"    - the underlying quantity is not the same.\n"

#. CALCULEL4_8 [machine]
