msgstr ""
"\n"
"The <%(k1)s> bisection for law IRRAD3M found no solution within\n"
"the given number of iterations <%(i1)d>.\n"
"Debugging information\n"
"   Bound 0                 : <%(r1).15E>\n"
"   Bound 1                 : <%(r2).15E>\n"
"   Power N                 : <%(r3).15E>\n"
"   Search step             : <%(r4).15E>\n"
"   RM                      : <%(r5).15E>\n"
"   EU                      : <%(r6).15E>\n"
"   R02                     : <%(r7).15E>\n"
