#. COMPOR2_47 [assisted]
#: code_aster/Messages/compor2.py:260
#, python-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"  CALC_ESSAI_GEOMECA : Erreur dans la saisie du mot clef facteur <%(k1)s> (occurrence %(i1)d).\n"
"  Incohérence entre les valeurs saisies pour les mot clef simples <PRES_CONF>, <SIGM_IMPO> et <SIGM_décharge>.\n"
"  On doit toujours avoir PRES_CONF + SIGM_IMPO <= SIGM_décharge .\n"
"  Or vous avez renseigné < PRES_CONF = %(r1)E> et <SIGM_IMPO = %(r2)E>, soit PRES_CONF + SIGM_IMPO = %(r3)E supérieur à %(r4)E\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"  CALC_ESSAI_GEOMECA: input error in factor keyword <%(k1)s> (occurrence %(i1)d).\n"
"  Inconsistency between the values given for simple keywords <PRES_CONF>, <SIGM_IMPO> and <SIGM_décharge>.\n"
"  PRES_CONF + SIGM_IMPO <= SIGM_décharge must always hold.\n"
"  But you gave < PRES_CONF = %(r1)E> and <SIGM_IMPO = %(r2)E>, so PRES_CONF + SIGM_IMPO = %(r3)E is greater than %(r4)E\n"

