msgstr ""
"\n"
"The path to the element catalog is too long. It must be shorter than\n"
"%(i1)d characters. It is defined by environment variable '%(k1)s'.\n"
"\n"
"Advice:\n"
"    Install Code_Aster in a shorter path, or create\n"
