"     Le solveur '%(k1)s' n'est actuellement autorisé qu'avec les algorithmes de contact 'GCP','VERIF' et 'PENALISATION'.\n"
"\n"
"  -> Conseil :\n"
"     Changez d'algorithme de contact en utilisant le mot-clé ALGO_CONT de DEFI_CONTACT ou bien changez de solveur linéaire\n"
"     en utilisant le mot-clé METHODE de SOLVEUR.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
" - > You use jointly a formulation 'DISCRETE' of contact with the linear solver  %(k1)s. \n"
" The solver  %(k1)s is currently authorized only with contact algorithms 'GCP', 'VERIF' and 'PENALISATION'. \n"
" \n"
" - > Advices: \n"
" Change contact algorithm into using key word ALGO_CONT of DEFI_CONTACT or change linear solver\n"
" by using key word METHODE of SOLVER. \n"

#. MECANONLINE3_91 [machine]
#: code_aster/Messages/mecanonline3.py:64
