"   NB_HARM_NONL >= NB_HARM_LINE\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"   The number of harmonics of the contact forces must be greater than or equal to the number of harmonics of the other variables.\n"
"   NB_HARM_NONL >= NB_HARM_LINE\n"

