"         Conseil :\n"
"             Vérifiez la qualité de l'appariement visuellement .\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"         A non-fatal error was detected while pairing two cells.\n"
"         This pair is ignored; there may be interpenetration between these two cells.\n"
"         Advice:\n"
"             Check the quality of the pairing visually.\n"

#. MESH4_4 [assisted]
