"\n"
"Node %(k1)s should almost certainly be projected onto\n"
"element %(k2)s, but this is refused because the distance\n"
"between the node and the element is not compatible with the thickness\n"
"and offset of the element.\n"
"This (signed) distance must be between %(r3)f and %(r2)f, but\n"
"the computed value is %(r1)f.\n"

