"      Tabulez votre formule, à une finesse de discrétisation d'abscisse (TEMP) à votre convenance,\n"
"      par la commande CALC_FONC_INTERP\n"
" "
msgstr ""
"\n"
" - > In thermal, the functions defining the material (enthalpy, heat capacity, conductivity)\n"
" must obligatorily be described by tabulated functions and not of the formulas. \n"
" Indeed, one needs to evaluate derivative of these functions. It can be more easily and\n"
" precisely obtained for a linear function per pieces that for a statement 'formulates'. \n"
" - > Advices: \n"
