"\n"
"Advice: create POI1 elements with the CREA_MAILLAGE/CREA_POI1 operator\n"
"          then rebuild the MODELE with AFFE_MODELE/AFFE/GROUP_MA only.\n"

#. PARTITION_4 [assisted]
