"\n"
" Advice:\n"
"   - increase the number of subdomains of the partition in the DISTRIBUTION keyword\n"
"   - decrease the number of processors for the computation\n"

#. PARTITION1_2 [assisted]
#: code_aster/Messages/partition1.py:32
msgid ""
"\n"
" Le partitionnement des mailles du maillage conduit à un sous-domaine ayant 0 maille.\n"
" Le code ne sait pas traiter ce cas de figure.\n"
" Conseils :\n"
"   - diminuez le nombre de processeurs du calcul.\n"
"   - diminuez le nombre de sous-domaines de la partition du mot-clé DISTRIBUTION\n"
"   - n'utilisez pas le parallélisme (trop peu d'éléments).\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
" Partitioning the mesh elements leads to a subdomain with 0 elements.\n"
" The code cannot handle this case.\n"
" Advice:\n"
"   - decrease the number of processors for the computation.\n"
"   - decrease the number of subdomains of the partition in the DISTRIBUTION keyword\n"
"   - do not use parallelism (too few elements).\n"
"\n"

#. PARTITION1_17 [machine]
#: code_aster/Messages/partition1.py:43
#, python-format
