msgstr ""
"\n"
" The partition %(k1)s that you use to partition models it %(k2)s in subdomains was built on another model ( %(k3)s). \n"
" \n"
" Advice: check the coherence of the models. \n"

#. PARTITION1_93 [machine]
#: code_aster/Messages/partition1.py:50
#, python-format
