" ETA_PILO_MAX must be lower than ETA_PILO_R_MAX \n"

#. PILOTAGE_49 [machine]
#: code_aster/Messages/pilotage.py:48
msgid ""
"\n"
" ETA_PILO_MIN doit être supérieur à ETA_PILO_R_MIN\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
" ETA_PILO_MIN must be higher than ETA_PILO_R_MIN \n"

#. PILOTAGE_50 [machine]
#: code_aster/Messages/pilotage.py:53
msgid ""
"\n"
" Il ne faut pas plus d'un noeud pour le pilotage DDL_IMPO.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
" One does not need more than one node for control DDL_IMPO. \n"

#. PILOTAGE_55 [machine]
#: code_aster/Messages/pilotage.py:58
#, python-format
msgid ""
"\n"
" La liste des directions est vide pour le mot-clef %(k1)s pour le pilotage %(k2)s.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
" The list of the directions is empty for the keyword %(k1)s for control %(k2)s. \n"

#. PILOTAGE_56 [machine]
#: code_aster/Messages/pilotage.py:63
#, python-format
msgid ""
"\n"
" Il faut une et une seule direction pour le mot-clef %(k1)s pour le pilotage de type %(k2)s.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
" One needs one and only one direction for the keyword %(k1)s for the control of the type %(k2)s. \n"

#. PILOTAGE_57 [machine]
#: code_aster/Messages/pilotage.py:68
msgid ""
"\n"
" Il faut plus d'un noeud pour le pilotage LONG_ARC.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
" One needs more than one node for control LONG_ARC. \n"

#. PILOTAGE_83 [machine]
#: code_aster/Messages/pilotage.py:73
msgid ""
"\n"
" Problème lors du pilotage.\n"
" Nombre maximum d'itérations atteint.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
" Problem during control. \n"
" Maximum number of iterations reached. \n"

#. PILOTAGE_84 [machine]
#: code_aster/Messages/pilotage.py:79
msgid ""
