msgstr ""
"The model cannot be extracted from the first occurrence of\n"
"RESU_MECA or RESU_MECA_TRAN.\n"
"\n"
"Advice:\n"
"Give the model with keyword MODELE, or reorder the occurrences so that\n"
"load type SISM_INER_SPEC is not first."

#. POSTROCHE_5 [assisted]
#: code_aster/Messages/postroche.py:43
