msgstr ""
"\n"
" Method %(k1)s is illegal\n"

#. PREPOST_5 [assisted]
#: code_aster/Messages/prepost.py:45
msgid ""
"\n"
" Le rapport entre le module de Young du revêtement et celui du métal de base doit être compris entre 0,7 et 1.\n"
" En dehors de ces bornes, l'interpolation  barycentrique n'est pas possible.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
" The ratio of the Young's modulus of the cladding to that of the base metal must be between 0.7 and 1.\n"
" Outside these bounds, barycentric interpolation is not possible.\n"

