msgstr ""
"For modal combination COMB_MODE with TYPE = 'GUPTA', FREQ_1 must be less than FREQ_2.\n"

#. SEISME_59 [assisted]
#: code_aster/Messages/seisme.py:154
msgid ""
"La combinaison modale COMB_MODE de TYPE = 'GUPTA' est uniquement disponible en MONO_APPUI.\n"
