"\n"
" prohibited\" keyword\" MASS_MECA: \n"
" it is necessary to have made\" DEFINITION\" and\" RIGI_MECA\". \n"

#. SOUSTRUC_13 [machine]
#: code_aster/Messages/soustruc.py:84
msgid ""
"\n"
" mot-clef \"MASS_MECA\" interdit :\n"
" il est déjà calculé.\n"
