" with the nodes was required. \n"
" However the field by elements with the nodes contains\n"
" subpoints whereas a field with the nodes cannot contain some. \n"
" The meshes containing of the subpoints will be excluded. \n"
" \n"
" Advice: \n"
" If you wish to convert the field on the meshes having\n"
" subpoints, you must initially extract the field by elements\n"
" with the nodes on a subpoint with command POST_CHAMP. \n"

#. UTILITAI_4 [machine]
