#. VARC1_2 [assisted]
#: code_aster/Messages/varc1.py:29
msgid ""
"\n"
" Erreur d'utilisation (AFFE_MATERIAU/AFFE_VARC) :\n"
"  Le maillage associé au calcul est différent de celui associé aux champs affectés dans AFFE_MATERIAU/AFFE_VARC.\n"
"\n"
" Conseil :\n"
"  Il faut corriger AFFE_MATERIAU.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
" Usage error (AFFE_MATERIAU/AFFE_VARC):\n"
"  The mesh associated with the computation differs from the one associated with the fields assigned in AFFE_MATERIAU/AFFE_VARC.\n"
"\n"
" Advice:\n"
"  AFFE_MATERIAU must be corrected.\n"

#. VARC1_3 [assisted]
#: code_aster/Messages/varc1.py:38
#, python-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"La grandeur physique pour la variable de commande %(k1)s doit être  %(k2)s  mais elle est  %(k3)s.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"The physical quantity for external state variable %(k1)s must be  %(k2)s  but it is  %(k3)s.\n"

#. VARC1_4 [assisted]
#: code_aster/Messages/varc1.py:43
#, python-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"   Le champ de la variable de commande %(k1)s est associé à un modèle qui n'est pas celui du calcul.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"   The field of external state variable %(k1)s is associated with a model that is not the one of the computation.\n"

#. VARC1_5 [assisted]
#: code_aster/Messages/varc1.py:48
#, python-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"   Le champ de la variable de commande %(k1)s est associé à une option %(k2)s qui n'est pas 'INIT_VARC'\n"
"   Ce champ n'a sans doute pas été produit par PROJ_CHAMP / METHODE='SOUS_POINT'\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"   The field of external state variable %(k1)s is associated with an option %(k2)s that is not 'INIT_VARC'\n"
"   This field was probably not produced by PROJ_CHAMP / METHODE='SOUS_POINT'\n"

#. VARC1_6 [assisted]
#: code_aster/Messages/varc1.py:54
#, python-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"Erreur utilisateur dans la commande AFFE_MATERIAU / AFFE_VARC\n"
"  Pour la variable de commande %(k1)s, la grandeur associée du champ doit être %(k2)s  mais elle est %(k3)s.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"User error in the AFFE_MATERIAU / AFFE_VARC command\n"
"  For external state variable %(k1)s, the associated quantity of the field must be %(k2)s  but it is %(k3)s.\n"

#. VARC1_7 [assisted]
#: code_aster/Messages/varc1.py:60
#, python-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"  Pour la variable de commande %(k1)s, le champ est de type %(k2)s, ce n'est pas possible.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"  For external state variable %(k1)s, the field is of type %(k2)s, which is not possible.\n"

#. VARC1_8 [assisted]
#: code_aster/Messages/varc1.py:65
#, python-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"  Pour la variable de commande %(k1)s, le champ a %(i1)d variables, or on en attend %(i2)d.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"  For external state variable %(k1)s, the field has %(i1)d variables, but %(i2)d are expected.\n"

#. VARC1_9 [assisted]
#: code_aster/Messages/varc1.py:70
#, python-format
msgid ""
"\n"
" Erreur d'utilisation (préparation des variables de commande) :\n"
" Pour la variable de commande %(k1)s, il y a une incohérence du\n"
" nombre de \"sous-points\" entre le CARA_ELEM (%(i1)d) et le CHAM_MATER (%(i2)d).\n"
"\n"
" Conseil :\n"
" N'avez-vous pas défini plusieurs CARA_ELEM conduisant à des nombres de\n"
" \"sous-points\" différents (COQUE_NCOU, TUYAU_NCOU, ...) ?\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
" Usage error (preparation of the external state variables):\n"
" For external state variable %(k1)s, the number of \"sub-points\" is inconsistent\n"
" between the CARA_ELEM (%(i1)d) and the CHAM_MATER (%(i2)d).\n"
"\n"
" Advice:\n"
" Did you define several CARA_ELEM leading to different numbers of\n"
" \"sub-points\" (COQUE_NCOU, TUYAU_NCOU, ...)?\n"

#. VERIFERRAILLAGE_1 [assisted]
#: code_aster/Messages/veriferraillage.py:23
msgid ""
"\n"
" Commande VERI_FERRAILLAGE :\n"
"   CHAM_FERR : Le champ de densité de ferraillage entré n'est pas un champ élémentaire constant par élément. Veuillez entrer un champ élémentaire constant par élément.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
" VERI_FERRAILLAGE:\n"
"   CHAM_FERR: the reinforcement density field given is not an elementary field constant per element. Give an elementary field constant per element.\n"

#. VERIFERRAILLAGE_2 [assisted]
#: code_aster/Messages/veriferraillage.py:29
msgid ""
"\n"
" Commande VERI_FERRAILLAGE :\n"
"   CHAM_FERR : Le champ entré ne contient pas les densités de ferraillage.\n"
"   Conseil : on suggère de créer un champ élémentaire de type ELEM_FER2_R avec la commande CREA_CHAMP.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
" VERI_FERRAILLAGE:\n"
"   CHAM_FERR: the field given does not contain the reinforcement densities.\n"
"   Advice: create an elementary field of type ELEM_FER2_R with CREA_CHAMP.\n"

#. VERIFERRAILLAGE_3 [assisted]
#: code_aster/Messages/veriferraillage.py:36
msgid ""
"\n"
" Commande VERI_FERRAILLAGE :\n"
"   CHAM_FERR : Le maillage associé à CHAM_FERR est différent de celui associé au modèle de calcul.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
" VERI_FERRAILLAGE:\n"
"   CHAM_FERR: the mesh associated with CHAM_FERR differs from the one associated with the computation model.\n"

#. VERIFERRAILLAGE_5 [assisted]
#: code_aster/Messages/veriferraillage.py:48
msgid ""
"\n"
" Commande VERI_FERRAILLAGE :\n"
"   CHAM_REFE : Le champ des efforts généralisés en entré ne contient pas la grandeur SIEF_R (qui contient les efforts généralisés). Veuillez entrer un champ élémentaire contenant la grandeur ELEM_FER2_R.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
" VERI_FERRAILLAGE:\n"
"   CHAM_REFE: the input generalized force field does not contain physical quantity SIEF_R (which holds the generalized forces). Give an elementary field containing physical quantity ELEM_FER2_R.\n"

#. VERIFERRAILLAGE_6 [assisted]
#: code_aster/Messages/veriferraillage.py:54
msgid ""
"\n"
" Commande VERI_FERRAILLAGE :\n"
"   CHAM_REFE : Le maillage associé à CHAM_REFE est différent de celui associé au modèle de calcul.\n"
"   "
msgstr ""
"\n"
" VERI_FERRAILLAGE:\n"
"   CHAM_REFE: the mesh associated with CHAM_REFE differs from the one associated with the computation model.\n"
"   "

#. VERIFERRAILLAGE_8 [assisted]
#: code_aster/Messages/veriferraillage.py:66
msgid ""
"\n"
" Erreur utilisateur commande VERI_FERRAILLAGE / TYPE_COMB = ELU :\n"
"   Certains mots-clé de VERI_FERRAILLAGE / AFFE sont obligatoires pour un calcul à l'ELU :\n"
"     pour CODIFICATION = 'BAEL91' : FE, FCJ, GAMMA_S, GAMMA_C, TYPE_DIAGRAMME et EYS\n"
"     pour CODIFICATION = 'EC2' : FYK, FCK, GAMMA_S, GAMMA_C, TYPE_DIAGRAMME et EYS\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
" User error in VERI_FERRAILLAGE / TYPE_COMB = ELU:\n"
"   Some keywords of VERI_FERRAILLAGE / AFFE are required for an ULS (ELU) computation:\n"
"     for CODIFICATION = 'BAEL91': FE, FCJ, GAMMA_S, GAMMA_C, TYPE_DIAGRAMME and EYS\n"
"     for CODIFICATION = 'EC2': FYK, FCK, GAMMA_S, GAMMA_C, TYPE_DIAGRAMME and EYS\n"

#. VERIFERRAILLAGE_9 [assisted]
#: code_aster/Messages/veriferraillage.py:74
msgid ""
"\n"
" Erreur utilisateur commande VERI_FERRAILLAGE / TYPE_COMB = ELS :\n"
"   Certains mots-clé de VERI_FERRAILLAGE / AFFE sont obligatoires pour un calcul à l'ELS :\n"
"     pour CODIFICATION = 'BAEL91' : N,SIGS_ELS,SIGC_INF_ELS,SIGC_SUP_ELS\n"
"     pour CODIFICATION = 'EC2' : ALPHA_E,SIGS_ELS,SIGC_INF_ELS,SIGC_SUP_ELS,EYS\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
" User error in VERI_FERRAILLAGE / TYPE_COMB = ELS:\n"
"   Some keywords of VERI_FERRAILLAGE / AFFE are required for an SLS (ELS) computation:\n"
"     for CODIFICATION = 'BAEL91': N,SIGS_ELS,SIGC_INF_ELS,SIGC_SUP_ELS\n"
"     for CODIFICATION = 'EC2': ALPHA_E,SIGS_ELS,SIGC_INF_ELS,SIGC_SUP_ELS,EYS\n"

#. VERIFERRAILLAGE_10 [assisted]
#: code_aster/Messages/veriferraillage.py:82
msgid ""
"\n"
" Erreur commande VERI_FERRAILLAGE :\n"
"   On n'a pas réussi à calculer la carte de marge sur un élément.\n"
"   (h/2-c) est négatif ou nul (l'utilisateur a fourni des valeurs d'enrobage incompatibles avec l'épaisseur de l'élément)\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
" Error in VERI_FERRAILLAGE:\n"
"   The margin map could not be computed on an element.\n"
"   (h/2-c) is negative or zero (the user gave cover values incompatible with the element thickness)\n"

#. VERIFERRAILLAGE_11 [assisted]
#: code_aster/Messages/veriferraillage.py:89
msgid ""
"\n"
" Commande VERI_FERRAILLAGE :\n"
"  Le point correspondant aux efforts généralisés de référence est situé en dehors du diagramme d'interaction sur au moins une facette.\n"
"  La marge dans ce cas est fixée égale à 2.0. Les efforts normaux et moments résistants de rupture\n"
"  et la distance entre le point correspondant au torseur de référence et celui correspondant au torseur résistant de rupture sont fixés à -1. Les valeurs relatives à l'état de la section sont fixées à -1.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
" VERI_FERRAILLAGE:\n"
"  The point corresponding to the reference generalized forces lies outside the interaction diagram on at least one facet.\n"
"  In that case the margin is set to 2.0. The ultimate resisting normal forces and moments,\n"
"  and the distance between the point of the reference force resultant and that of the ultimate resisting resultant, are set to -1. The values describing the section state are set to -1.\n"

#. VERIFERRAILLAGE_12 [assisted]
#: code_aster/Messages/veriferraillage.py:97
msgid ""
"\n"
" Commande POST_VERI_FERRAILLAGE :\n"
"  Le groupe de mailles ne fait pas partie du maillage sur lequel le champ de marge s'appuie. Veuillez fournir un autre GROUP_MA.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
" POST_VERI_FERRAILLAGE:\n"
"  The element group is not part of the mesh on which the margin field is based. Give another GROUP_MA.\n"

#. VERIFERRAILLAGE_13 [assisted]
#: code_aster/Messages/veriferraillage.py:103
msgid ""
"\n"
" Commande POST_VERI_FERRAILLAGE :\n"
"  Aucune maille n'a une marge inférieure au seuil. Veuillez définir un seuil supérieur.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
" POST_VERI_FERRAILLAGE:\n"
"  No element has a margin below the threshold. Define a higher threshold.\n"

#. VERIFERRAILLAGE_14 [assisted]
#: code_aster/Messages/veriferraillage.py:109
msgid ""
"\n"
" Commande POST_VERI_FERRAILLAGE :\n"
"  Le nombre de diagrammes demandés est supérieur au nombre total de mailles. Veuillez fournir un nombre NB_DIAG inférieur au nombre total de mailles.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
" POST_VERI_FERRAILLAGE:\n"
"  The number of diagrams requested exceeds the total number of elements. Give an NB_DIAG smaller than the total number of elements.\n"

#. VERIFERRAILLAGE_15 [assisted]
#: code_aster/Messages/veriferraillage.py:115
msgid ""
"\n"
" Commande POST_VERI_FERRAILLAGE :\n"
"  Un seul mot-clé doit être fourni parmi : 'GROUP_MA', 'SEUIL_MIN_MARGE' ou 'NB_DIAG'.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
" POST_VERI_FERRAILLAGE:\n"
"  Exactly one keyword must be given among 'GROUP_MA', 'SEUIL_MIN_MARGE' and 'NB_DIAG'.\n"

#. VERIFERRAILLAGE_16 [assisted]
#: code_aster/Messages/veriferraillage.py:121
msgid ""
"\n"
" Commande POST_VERI_FERRAILLAGE :\n"
"  Le calcul des valeurs liées à l'état de la section n'est possible que pour les classes de béton inférieures ou égales à 50 MPa.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
" POST_VERI_FERRAILLAGE:\n"
"  The values describing the section state can only be computed for concrete classes up to 50 MPa.\n"

#. VERIFERRAILLAGE_17 [assisted]
#: code_aster/Messages/veriferraillage.py:127
msgid ""
"\n"
" Commande POST_VERI_FERRAILLAGE :\n"
"  La marge est négative pour le torseur d'efforts de calcul. les valeurs de l'état de la section correspondant à l'état limite seront fournies.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
" POST_VERI_FERRAILLAGE:\n"
"  The margin is negative for the design force resultant. The section state values corresponding to the limit state will be given.\n"

#. VERIFERRAILLAGE_18 [assisted]
#: code_aster/Messages/veriferraillage.py:133
msgid ""
"\n"
" Commande POST_VERI_FERRAILLAGE :\n"
"  Lorsque le torseur des efforts de référence coïncide avec le torseur des efforts de calcul, les efforts normaux et moments résistants de rupture\n"
"  et la distance entre le point correspondant au torseur de référence et celui correspondant au torseur résistant de rupture sont fixés à -1.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
" POST_VERI_FERRAILLAGE:\n"
"  When the reference force resultant coincides with the design force resultant, the ultimate resisting normal forces and moments,\n"
"  and the distance between the point of the reference resultant and that of the ultimate resisting resultant, are set to -1.\n"

#. VERIFERRAILLAGE_19 [assisted]
#: code_aster/Messages/veriferraillage.py:140
msgid ""
"\n"
" Commande POST_VERI_FERRAILLAGE :\n"
"  On ne retrouve aucune solution d'équilibre pour la section et le torseur d'effort donnés aux ELS.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
" POST_VERI_FERRAILLAGE:\n"
"  No equilibrium solution was found for the section and the force resultant given at SLS (ELS).\n"

#. VOLUFINI_2 [assisted]
