#. XFEM_22 [assisted]
#: code_aster/Messages/xfem.py:191
#, python-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"     Une relation cinématique est imposée au niveau du noeud %(k1)s sur lequel une\n"
"     fissure passe et cette relation est imposée de part et d'autre de la fissure.\n"
"     Deux relations sont donc imposées, bloquant ainsi le ddl Heaviside associé.\n"
"     Si vous avez également imposé une relation cinématique sur le degré de liberté\n"
"     Heaviside associé du noeud  %(k1)s, la matrice sera non factorisable.\n"
"     Conseil :\n"
"     Vous pouvez exclure le noeud %(k1)s du groupe affecté par\n"
"     cette deuxième relation en utilisant par exemple l'opérande DIFFE.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"     A kinematic relation is imposed at node %(k1)s, through which a\n"
"     crack passes, and this relation is imposed on both sides of the crack.\n"
"     Two relations are therefore imposed, which blocks the associated Heaviside DOF.\n"
"     If you also imposed a kinematic relation on the associated Heaviside degree\n"
"     of freedom of node %(k1)s, the matrix cannot be factorized.\n"
"     Advice:\n"
"     You can exclude node %(k1)s from the group concerned by\n"
"     this second relation, for example with operand DIFFE.\n"

#. XFEM_23 [machine]
#: code_aster/Messages/xfem.py:203
#, python-format
