msgstr ""
"\n"
" Error in the choice of the method of calculating of the level-sets. \n"
" You wish to define a crack. \n"
" For that it is necessary to define 2 level-sets: LT and LN. \n"
" Advice: \n"
" Want inform %(k1)s. \n"

#. XFEM_25 [machine]
#: code_aster/Messages/xfem.py:222
#, python-format
