" Error in the choice of the method of calculating of the level-sets. \n"
" You wish to define an application interface. \n"
" For that one should not is not to define the level-set norm LT. \n"
"  %(k1)s will not be considered. \n"
" Advice: \n"
" Not to obtain this message any more, do not inform %(k1)s. \n"

